    {
      "kind": "announce",
      "text": "大家好,我是陈果!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "announce",
      "text": "我是多多!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "announce",
      "text": "周三,一周过了一半,宇宙怪事时间到。今天问你一句:开车去月球,得开多久?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "从地球开车到月球,一路不停,你猜要开多久?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "一小时?一天?一星期?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "都不对,要一直开,开满166天。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "差不多是半年,这还是一路不停车的算法。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "166天,到底有多久?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "text": "",
      "seconds": 2.0,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": null,
      "step": "",
      "emotion": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "暑假放假,一般是60天左右,166天差不多是快三个暑假。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "放完第一个暑假,肯定玩腻了!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "放完第二个暑假,你玩腻了两次。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "还剩下大半个暑假,车还在路上,月亮还没到。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "啊?这么慢!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "没到。你家到最近的城市,可能也就几十公里。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "地球到月亮,差不多是38万公里,相当于来回跑这段路一万次。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "一万次?!下次抬头看月亮,它其实没那么近啊。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "flip",
      "text": "你以为怪的是月球很远。其实怪的是——远到开车这个词在这儿根本不管用!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "retell",
      "text": "开车去月球,要开166天,比放三个暑假还久。一直不停车才行。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "好啦,今天就聊到这儿。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "下次想去月球玩,还是坐火箭比较快!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "preview",
      "text": "明天,我们认识一个人。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "preview",
      "text": "第一个飞上天的人,前一晚在想什么?我们明天见!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    }
  ],
